      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "噂話で、帝都に素敵な踊り手さんがいて\nとても上手くて評判だってきいたわ。\nねえ、それってあなたのことよね？\nぜひ私の所にも来てほしいの。興行を頼めるかしら？",
        "official_en": "Rumor is there's a lovely dancer making a name for\nherself in the imperial capital. That's you, isn't it?\nWould you consider coming here to perform for us?\nIt would be a delight!",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
