      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "んもう！　噂なんて、全然当てにならないものね！\nあなた……噂以上に上手で、素敵だったわ！\n教えてくれた人に言っておかなくっちゃ。\n噂なんて信じるなって！　ありがとう！",
        "official_en": "Gods, the rumors got it dead wrong... You were even\nbetter, and lovelier, than I'd been told! I'd better go\nback to the person who told me about you and set\nher straight. Moral is—don't believe rumors!",
